		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よーし！　準備　バッチリ！
勝負の　旅に　レッツで　ゴー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
