		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>５０連勝まで　あと一歩！
がぜん　気合が　入りますわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
